  "body": "Goal: Help an eligible creator understand the rehearsal service, capabilities, limits and commercial rules using supported knowledge.\n\n## Candidate questions\n- Does the MyyShop rehearsal guarantee income or AI placement, and how are report data and privacy handled?\n- How can I compare the MyyShop rehearsal service with other creator campaign services?\n- What are the MyyShop rehearsal fees, trial length, cancellation and refund rules?\n- What capabilities does the MyyShop rehearsal support, and what automation or fulfillment is unavailable?\n- What is the MyyShop rehearsal service, and who is it designed for?\n- Who is eligible to use the MyyShop rehearsal, and what onboarding steps apply?\n\n## Maintenance\n- identity: candidate\n- legacy: candidate\n- positioning: candidate\n- non-goals: candidate\n- eligibility: candidate\n- onboarding: candidate\n- campaigns: candidate\n- automation: candidate\n- fees: candidate\n- refund: candidate\n- privacy: candidate\n- guarantees: candidate\n- case: candidate\n- growth: stale\n- voice: candidate\n- expired: stale\n- answer-definition: candidate\n- comparison: candidate\n\nApproval covers supported facts and this Query selection. Missing or expired evidence remains outside the frozen knowledge slice.",
  "body_sha256": "76c4705c1f84ebce05b1a4161b99c35796c3cbbe483b570b0cd4cba0690c3584",
